==Trivia==
*"Aegis" is a word that comes from Greek and means "shield", referring to how Garu uses his shield-like wings to attack and his resistance to traited enemies.
*This is the first unit to have the Mini-Wave ability.
*Mighty Aegis Garu is one of the units to have his description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "Wave Immunity, with Mini-Wave Omnistrikes" was changed to "Mini-Wave Omnistrikes, Immune to Waves".

